Trends. ","Advantages & Disadvantages","advantages-disadvantages","/google-trends/advantages-disadvantages/",3,[59,62,65],{"title":60,"slug":61},"Benefits","benefits",{"title":63,"slug":64},"Disadvantages","disadvantages",{"title":66,"slug":67},"Overcoming limitations","overcoming-limitations",{"title":69,"meta_title":69,"meta_description":70,"short_title":71,"slug":72,"full_slug":73,"index":74,"order":75,"sections":76},"How Accurate and Reliable Is Google Trends?","A breakdown of Google Trends' accuracy, where the data comes from, and how reliable it is.","Accuracy of the Data","accuracy","/google-trends/accuracy/",2,4,[77,79,82,85],{"title":78,"slug":72},"Accuracy",{"title":80,"slug":81},"Reliability","reliability",{"title":83,"slug":84},"Common Misinterpretations","common-misinterpretations",{"title":86,"slug":87},"Data sources","data-sources",{"title":89,"meta_title":89,"meta_description":90,"short_title":91,"slug":92,"full_slug":93,"index":57,"order":94,"sections":95},"How to See Absolute Number of Searches in Google Trends","See absolute numbers in Google Trends instead of a 0-100 index.","Absolute Number of Searches","search-volume","/google-trends/search-volume/",7,[96,99,102,105,108,111,114,117,120,123],{"title":97,"slug":98},"See absolute number of searches","see-absolute-number-of-searches",{"title":100,"slug":101},"Understand the 0-100 index","understand-the-index",{"title":103,"slug":104},"Understand 'search interest'","understand-search-interest",{"title":106,"slug":107},"Understand the Y-axis","understand-the-y-axis",{"title":109,"slug":110},"What do the numbers mean?","what-do-the-numbers-mean",{"title":112,"slug":113},"What Google Trends measures","what-google-trends-measures",{"title":115,"slug":116},"What does search volume index mean?","what-does-search-volume-index-mean",{"title":118,"slug":119},"How to read and interpret","how-to-read-and-interpret",{"title":121,"slug":122},"Does Google Trends show search volume?","does-google-trends-show-search-volume",{"title":124,"slug":125},"How to find Google search volume?","how-to-find-google-search-volume",{"title":127,"meta_title":127,"meta_description":128,"short_title":129,"slug":130,"full_slug":131,"index":75,"order":132,"sections":133},"How to Compare Terms in Google Trends","Learn how to use one of Google Trends' most powerful features and overcome its built-in limitations. ","Comparing Terms","compare-terms","/google-trends/compare-terms/",8,[134,136,139],{"title":135,"slug":130},"Compare 2-5 terms",{"title":137,"slug":138},"Compare more than 5 terms","compare-more-than-terms",{"title":140,"slug":141},"Compare terms by Region","compare-terms-by-region",{"title":143,"meta_title":143,"meta_description":144,"short_title":145,"slug":146,"full_slug":147,"index":148,"order":149,"sections":150},"Advanced Boolean Search in Google Trends","Learn to use advanced boolean search operators in Google Trends to refine results and uncover unique insights. ","Advanced Boolean Search","advanced-boolean-search","/google-trends/advanced-boolean-search/",5,9,[151,154,157],{"title":152,"slug":153},"List of operators","list-of-operators",{"title":155,"slug":156},"Combine boolean operators","combine-boolean-operators",{"title":158,"slug":159},"Additional notes","additional-notes",{"title":161,"meta_title":161,"meta_description":162,"short_title":163,"slug":164,"full_slug":165,"index":166,"order":167,"sections":168},"Search Terms vs. Topics in Google Trends","Understand the differences between Google's two types of queries: Search Terms and Topics","Search Terms vs. Topics","search-term-vs-topic","/google-trends/search-term-vs-topic/",6,10,[169,172,175,178,181],{"title":170,"slug":171},"Key differences","key-differences",{"title":173,"slug":174},"Search terms","search-terms",{"title":176,"slug":177},"Topics","topics",{"title":179,"slug":180},"When to use each","when-to-use-each",{"title":182,"slug":183},"Get the benefits of Topics without the quality issues","get-the-benefits-of-topics-without-the-quality-issues",{"title":185,"meta_title":185,"meta_image":186,"meta_description":190,"short_title":191,"slug":192,"full_slug":193,"index":94,"order":194,"sections":195},"Google Trends For SEO",{"id":14,"title":8,"description":15,"file":187},{"url":7,"details":188,"fileName":22,"contentType":23},{"size":18,"image":189},{"width":20,"height":21},"Maximize SEO performance with the world's most powerful search tool. Spot trending keywords, optimize timing, tailor content, and much more. ","SEO","keyword-research","/google-trends/keyword-research/",12,[196,199,202,205,208,211],{"title":197,"slug":198},"How to use Google Trends for SEO","how-to-use-google-trends-for-seo",{"title":200,"slug":201},"Choosing a topic","choosing-a-topic",{"title":203,"slug":204},"Planning your content calendar","planning-your-content-calendar",{"title":206,"slug":207},"Tailoring by region","tailoring-by-region",{"title":209,"slug":210},"Benchmarking performance","benchmarking-performance",{"title":54,"slug":212},"advantages-and-disadvantages",{"title":214,"meta_title":214,"meta_image":215,"meta_description":219,"short_title":220,"slug":221,"full_slug":222,"index":132,"order":223,"sections":224},"Google Trends For Product Research & eCommerce",{"id":14,"title":8,"description":15,"file":216},{"url":7,"details":217,"fileName":22,"contentType":23},{"size":18,"image":218},{"width":20,"height":21},"How to use Google Trends to find trending products, optimize ecommerce listings for SEO, and more.","Product Research & eCommerce","product-research","/google-trends/product-research/",13,[225,228,231,234,237,240,243],{"title":226,"slug":227},"Find trending products","find-trending-products",{"title":229,"slug":230},"Optimize product listings","optimize-product-listings",{"title":232,"slug":233},"Benchmark internal performance","benchmark-internal-performance",{"title":235,"slug":236},"Manage inventory","manage-inventory",{"title":238,"slug":239},"Inform catalog decisions","inform-catalog-decisions",{"title":241,"slug":242},"Channel-specific tips","channel-specific-tips",{"title":244,"slug":245},"Advantages for eCommerce","advantages-for-ecommerce",{"title":247,"meta_title":247,"meta_image":248,"meta_description":252,"short_title":253,"slug":254,"full_slug":255,"index":149,"order":256,"sections":257},"Google Trends For Stock Market Trading & Investing",{"id":14,"title":8,"description":15,"file":249},{"url":7,"details":250,"fileName":22,"contentType":23},{"size":18,"image":251},{"width":20,"height":21},"Find alpha with the world's most powerful search data tool. Detect mispricings, spot market trends, measure hype, and more. ","Stock Market Trading & Investing","stock-trading","/google-trends/stock-trading/",14,[258,261,264,267,270,273,276,279,282],{"title":259,"slug":260},"1. Estimate revenue","estimate-revenue",{"title":262,"slug":263},"2. Spot mispricings","spot-mispricings",{"title":265,"slug":266},"3. Measure hype","measure-hype",{"title":268,"slug":269},"4. Cultural shifts","cultural-shifts",{"title":271,"slug":272},"5. Micro trends, macro shifts","micro-trends-macro-shifts",{"title":274,"slug":275},"6. Measure sentiment","measure-sentiment",{"title":277,"slug":278},"7. Behavioral insights via seasonality","behavioral-insights-via-seasonality",{"title":280,"slug":281},"8. Measure market share","measure-market-share",{"title":283,"slug":284},"9. Gauge PR impact","gauge-pr-impact",{"title":286,"meta_title":286,"meta_description":287,"short_title":288,"slug":289,"full_slug":290,"index":167,"order":291,"sections":292},"Google Trends Has No API (Do This Instead)","How to access Google Trends data via API","Google Trends API","api","/google-trends/api/",16,[293,296,299,302,305,308,311,314,317,320],{"title":294,"slug":295},"Alternatives to the Google Trends API","alternatives-to-the-google-trends-api",{"title":297,"slug":298},"Use Cases","use-cases",{"title":300,"slug":301},"Why there's no Google Trends API","why-theres-no-google-trends-api",{"title":